{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The suffix tree of one or more texts: the compressed trie of all their suffixes, built left to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right in O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") (Ukkonen, “On-Line Construction of Suffix Trees”, 1995)."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/Occurrence","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/SuffixLinksView-swift.struct"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(texts:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestCommonSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestRepeatedSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodeCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodes","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/root","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/textCount"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/children(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/edgeLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/isLeaf(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/occurrences(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/parent(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/pathLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/stringDepth(of:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuffixTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every suffix of every text ends at a leaf, the empty suffix included, and every internal node"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is a point where suffixes that agree so far go different ways, so the tree has at most 2"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + 1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nodes. A pattern is found in O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") steps down from the root, and the leaves below where it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends are its occurrences."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tree = SuffixTree(\"banana\")","tree.occurrences(of: \"ana\").map(\\.range)   \/\/ [3 ..< 6, 1 ..< 4]","tree.longestRepeatedSubstring?.range       \/\/ 3 ..< 6, \"ana\"","","let both = SuffixTree(texts: [\"xabxac\", \"abcabxabcd\"])","both.longestCommonSubstring                \/\/ text 1, 3 ..< 7: \"abxa\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nodes are numbered in preorder from the root at 0, so a node’s subtree is the nodes from it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"just before the next node that is not its descendant. Children come in the order of the symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that starts their edge: sorted when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", so the leaves are in the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their suffixes and match a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixArray"},{"type":"text","text":" of the same text; otherwise in the order the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbols first occur in the texts. Each text ends in a terminator of its own that sorts before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every symbol and belongs to no label."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tree converts to Grafluent’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and its suffix links are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a directed graph, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Each node takes 32 bytes and each symbol 4 more, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"texts’ codes, which the tree keeps."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuffixTree"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SuffixTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree.swift#L29"},"title":"SuffixTree","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SuffixStructures"}],"externalID":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://SuffixStructures/documentation/SuffixStructures/SuffixTree/stringDepth(of:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The number of symbols on the path from the root to the node, a terminator not counted.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree\/stringdepth(of:)","role":"symbol","title":"stringDepth(of:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/stringDepth(of:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stringDepth"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SuffixStructures/documentation/SuffixStructures/SuffixTree/parent(of:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The